{"words": [{"text": "أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "translation": "Those"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "(are) the ones who"}, {"text": "ٱشْتَرَوُا۟", "translation": "bought"}, {"text": "ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ", "translation": "the life"}, {"text": "ٱلدُّنْيَا", "translation": "(of) the world"}, {"text": "بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۖ", "translation": "for the Hereafter"}, {"text": "فَلَا", "translation": "so not"}, {"text": "يُخَفَّفُ", "translation": "will be lightened"}, {"text": "عَنْهُمُ", "translation": "for them"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَذَابُ", "translation": "the punishment"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "هُمْ", "translation": "they"}, {"text": "يُنصَرُونَ", "translation": "will be helped"}], "sahih": "Those are the ones who have bought the life of this world [in exchange] for the Hereafter, so the punishment will not be lightened for them, nor will they be aided."}